@startuml
title H-02: one wei of bioDaoToken blocks updateFundraiser forever
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FDEEEE
  ParticipantBorderColor #B54A4A
  LifeLineBorderColor #B54A4A
  ActorBackgroundColor #FDEEEE
  ActorBorderColor #B54A4A
}

actor Attacker as A
participant "Fundraiser\ncontract" as F
participant "bioDaoToken\n(ERC20)" as T
participant "Curation" as C

== Intended flow ==
F -> T : transfer(Curation, bioDaoTokenToDistribute)
F -> C : updateFundraiser()
C -> T : balanceOf(Curation)
C -> C : require(balance == bioDaoTokenToDistribute)
C -> C : isFundraiseSuccessful = true
note right of C #FDEEEE
  pledgers can now claim()
end note

== Attack ==
A -> T : transfer(Curation, 1 wei)
note right of A #FDEEEE
  front-runs, or is sent
  at any time before finalisation
end note
F -> T : transfer(Curation, bioDaoTokenToDistribute)
F -> C : updateFundraiser()
C -> T : balanceOf(Curation)
C -> C : balance == expected + 1 wei\nrevert Curation__BioDAOTokenForVestingNotSent()
note right of C #FDEEEE
  no path removes the extra wei;
  every retry reverts
end note
@enduml
